From 7c823ec5ba3d07318fbb36caafb8097eb5fbb3b1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JeyKul <jey@kulovac.de>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 23:19:08 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 30/35] WIP: drm/amdgpu: Xclipse 920 GFX: ring and IB tests
 pass

gfx_v10_0 for the Xclipse 920: firmware preloaded by EL3 (only wait for
RLC autoload), no KIQ (gfx queue mapped by PIO), MEC unhalted before the
gfx queue (PFP waits for it), no CE/GDS/HDP/SMUIO/golden registers, gfx
config from sgpu's gpu_info. GMC: GART table in system RAM, walker
fetches PDE/PTE by physical address, system aperture covers the TMR.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
